OL,5,G1800 The Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,6,G     Show
OL,7,     FThis week's Trunk of Funk comes
OL,8,     Ffrom Brooke Combe. The Scottish
OL,9,     Fsinger-songwriter grew up on a
OL,10,     Fsoundtrack of classic soul and
OL,11,     FR&B, influences that continue to
OL,12,     Fshape her own music.
